  "id": "gender-schema",
  "term": "gender schema",
  "definition": "Gender schema is a person’s internalized set of gender stereotypes that shapes how sensitive they are to traits and information seen as typical of males or females. It can influence how people perceive language, including making stereotype-inconsistent statements seem less natural or likely.",
